[COMMAND]:      git.global
[PACKAGE]:      GIT
[USE]:          dock -git global

[OUT]:          Add the email and user to the GIT config file.

[ACTIONS]:      git config --global user.email "storage.catnet@gmail.com"
                git config --global user.name "deathwalker66" 

[NOTES]:        Necessary to make any commit, this command identifies the user and email registered 
                in Bitbucked in the GIT configuration file.
